// ================== Sealed Sender Receiving Policy ==================
//
// Governs the users.unrestricted_unidentified_access column. This is a
// RECEIVING policy — sealed *sending* is always on. It controls WHO may send
// sealed sender messages TO the authenticated user:
//    allow_from_anyone = false (default): contacts-only. Only senders who hold
//      the user's Unidentified Access Key (shared via profile key) can reach
//      them sealed; the server rejects mismatched UAKs (constant-time compare).
//    allow_from_anyone = true: accept sealed sender from anyone, no UAK match
//      required (unrestricted_unidentified_access).

