/// ResyncRequired is sent instead of replay when the server cannot, or will
/// not, replay everything after the resume cursor the client supplied: the
/// cursor is older than the event log retains (or unusable), the channel's
/// buffer was trimmed past it, or the stream's total replay budget ran out.
